MtvCrVDaKy", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 22465, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_0162BwJXxBUjKqMtvCrVDaKy", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 26941, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_0132MMf4HdiLsqUR7Mr25ujQ", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after v2.3.1 was deployed to all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west); error rate was 18%. Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent healthy release (v2.3.1-rc and v2.3.1 were both unhealthy). The first rollback attempt stopped partway with an orchestrator error after us-east, leaving the service on mixed versions (us-east v2.3.0, us-west/eu-west v2.3.1). The second attempt finished in all regions. Current state: all regions on v2.3.0, healthy, error rate 0.2%. Follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 regression, and look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback."}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 57541, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_0132MMf4HdiLsqUR7Mr25ujQ", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 57541, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_0132MMf4HdiLsqUR7Mr25ujQ", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 59516, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_0178EXKXg77oM5yrxdKi92SW", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 59816, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_0178EXKXg77oM5yrxdKi92SW", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 59816, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_0178EXKXg77oM5yrxdKi92SW", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 65471, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is back on v2.3.0 in all three regions and healthy, and SEV2 incident INC-0001 is open.\n\n**Rollback**\n- **Starting state:** All regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) were on v2.3.1, failing health checks with an 18% error rate.\n- **Target version:** v2.3.0 is the most recent healthy release. The two releases after it, v2.3.1-rc and v2.3.1, were both unhealthy.\n- **First attempt:** It stopped with an orchestrator error after us-east. That left us-east on v2.3.0 and the other two regions still on v2.3.1.\n- **Second attempt:** Rolling back to a known-healthy version is safe to repeat, so I ran it again. This time it finished in all regions.\n- **Now:** All regions are on v2.3.0 and healthy, with a 0.2% error rate.\n\n**Incident**\n- The create request timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and saw INC-0001 had already been created, so I didn't retry. On-call should only have been paged once.\n- The incident covers what went wrong, both rollback attempts, the current state and two follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 problem, and look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01TgjLte9XA2iMSsvHkYfgDp", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01H6464mpBW6TVFZkBWnGD89", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01JEvXmyPmtEeHvygdeaCBEL", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01QML4aKzSDVV9STpVqVfDhe", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback only got through part of the way: us-east is on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. A rollback to a known-healthy version is safe to repeat, so I'll try once more.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Us7ZktpEKX9kJLCtysaVRq", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_0162BwJXxBUjKqMtvCrVDaKy", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_0132MMf4HdiLsqUR7Mr25ujQ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after v2.3.1 was deployed to all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west); error rate was 18%. Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent healthy release (v2.3.1-rc and v2.3.1 were both unhealthy). The first rollback attempt stopped partway with an orchestrator error after us-east, leaving the service on mixed versions (us-east v2.3.0, us-west/eu-west v2.3.1). The second attempt finished in all regions. Current state: all regions on v2.3.0, healthy, error rate 0.2%. Follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 regression, and look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback."}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The request timed out, so I'll check whether the incident got created before trying again. That way I don't page on-call twice.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_0178EXKXg77oM5yrxdKi92SW", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "checkout-api is back on v2.3.0 in all three regions and healthy, and SEV2 incident INC-0001 is open.\n\n**Rollback**\n- **Starting state:** All regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) were on v2.3.1, failing health checks with an 18% error rate.\n- **Target version:** v2.3.0 is the most recent healthy release. The two releases after it, v2.3.1-rc and v2.3.1, were both unhealthy.\n- **First attempt:** It stopped with an orchestrator error after us-east. That left us-east on v2.3.0 and the other two regions still on v2.3.1.\n- **Second attempt:** Rolling back to a known-healthy version is safe to repeat, so I ran it again. This time it finished in all regions.\n- **Now:** All regions are on v2.3.0 and healthy, with a 0.2% error rate.\n\n**Incident**\n- The create request timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and saw INC-0001 had already been created, so I didn't retry. On-call should only have been paged once.\n- The incident covers what went wrong, both rollback attempts, the current state and two follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 problem, and look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}